    <string name="advice_no_endpoint_title">Control channel not found</string>
    <string name="advice_no_endpoint">The headphones play sound, but they do not answer on any Bluetooth LE address that Sonic Control could find. Many earbuds only open the control channel when the case lid is closed and reopened, or when the manufacturer’s app is closed.</string>
